        "text": "<thinking> To implement the detect_image_labels.py file, I need to use a concrete external provider for detecting labels or objects in a static image. The Google Cloud Vision API is a suitable choice for this task. I will import the necessary modules from the Google Cloud Vision client library and use the label detection feature provided by the API. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the Google Cloud Vision client library and the use of the specific client class for label detection. </thinking>\n",
